<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 12:22:26 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>比尔·阿克曼 (Bill Ackman) 的 350 亿美元对冲基金拥有不到 50 名员工，从门卫到接待员，所有人都拥有数百万美元的公司股票</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/bill-ackmans-35-billion-hedge-fund-has-under-50-employees-and-all-of-them-from-janitors-to-receptionists-own-millions-in-company-stock/</link><description>亿万富翁投资者比尔·阿克曼表示，员工忠诚度会带来红利，他愿意投资数百万美元购买股票奖励，并允许夏季远程工作来赚取红利。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/BIllAckman-interview.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/bill-ackmans-35-billion-hedge-fund-has-under-50-employees-and-all-of-them-from-janitors-to-receptionists-own-millions-in-company-stock/</guid></item><item><title>斯科特·贝森特 (Scott Bessent) 如何利用金融工程为 2 万亿美元的赤字提供资金，同时保持其不变，并造成 1.45 万亿美元的缺口</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/treasury-borrowing-tbac-145-trillion-shortfall-bessent-debt/</link><description>警报是从屋内传来的。财政部借款咨询委员会表示，借款数学不再相加。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2250795897-e1786135549232.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/treasury-borrowing-tbac-145-trillion-shortfall-bessent-debt/</guid></item><item><title>特德·莱昂西斯：美国无与伦比的优势是适应</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/ted-leonsis-american-advantage-first-aol-instant-message/</link><description>我发送了第一条 AIM 消息。现在我拥有三支华盛顿运动队。以下是两者都告诉我美国真正的优势。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2265215378-e1785969567195.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 10:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/ted-leonsis-american-advantage-first-aol-instant-message/</guid></item><item><title>这位 33 岁的首席执行官押注婴儿潮一代追逐孙子，而千禧一代出售他们的第一套房子</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/kelley-blue-book-homes-john-liss-millennials-boomers/</link><description>“消费者渴望更好的工具来帮助他们做出一生中最重大的财务决策之一，”凯利蓝皮书之家首席执行官约翰·利斯说。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1642723450037.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/kelley-blue-book-homes-john-liss-millennials-boomers/</guid></item><item><title>Vanguard首席经济学家：人工智能与就业，仍处于ATM阶段</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/vanguard-chief-economist-ai-and-jobs-atm-phase/</link><description>与移动银行阶段相比，我们仍然更接近 ATM 阶段。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/adam_schickling_social_new.avif?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/vanguard-chief-economist-ai-and-jobs-atm-phase/</guid></item><item><title>GrayMatter Robotics首席执行官：FCC禁止中国机器人是正确的但仅靠保护并不能赢得机器人竞赛</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/why-did-fcc-ban-chinese-robots/</link><description>机器人技术不再只是另一个技术市场。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1766701809976.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/why-did-fcc-ban-chinese-robots/</guid></item><item><title>全球最大工作空间提供商的首席执行官表示，到 2040 年，通勤将会消失，而您的孩子会认为这是专业人士曾经做过的“疯狂的事情”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/ceo-workspace-iwg-mark-dixon-commuting-extinct-2040-gen-alpha-work-from-anywhere-return-to-office-over/</link><description>IWG 首席执行官马克·迪克森 (Mark Dixon) 表示，未来几代人会认为，老板们曾经让员工“跑 100 英里才能坐下来使用电脑”，这是“疯狂的事情”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-897448230-e1786114990679.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/ceo-workspace-iwg-mark-dixon-commuting-extinct-2040-gen-alpha-work-from-anywhere-return-to-office-over/</guid></item><item><title>雪佛龙如何成为大型石油公司的人工智能宠儿</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/how-chevron-became-the-ai-darling-of-big-oil/</link><description>雪佛龙与微软的西德克萨斯数据中心合作可能会引发新的大数据和人工智能趋势。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/250318_Chevron_GEplant-00517_Edited.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 07:11:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/how-chevron-became-the-ai-darling-of-big-oil/</guid></item><item><title>截至 2026 年 8 月 6 日的当前油价</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-06-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Price-of-Oil-August-6.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 11:00:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-06-2026/</guid></item><item><title>就在总统逃离该国之前，世界上最贫穷的国家之一花费了 1.7 亿美元购买无人使用的缆车系统</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/madagascar-cable-car-coup-rajoelina/</link><description>马达加斯加官员将用户每次出行的费用定在 70 至 90 美分之间。平均月薪为 72 美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2175942957-e1786021429341.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 13:05:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/madagascar-cable-car-coup-rajoelina/</guid></item></channel></rss>